WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:49.350
Someone once said:

00:01:49.350 --> 00:01:53.490
There's a Cosmos that has spicy 
petals and plenty of filling.

00:01:53.490 --> 00:01:57.020
A flower that blooms in the fall, 
when appetites are biggest...

00:01:57.020 --> 00:02:00.830
The Tacosmos!

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:06.870
There is an owl that resembles 
a giant rice cake,

00:02:06.870 --> 00:02:10.570
with a bean jam body and 
flesh made of sticky mochi...

00:02:10.570 --> 00:02:14.440
The Great Rice-Caked Owl!

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:18.110
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:22.750
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:24.450 --> 00:02:26.950
Toriko and the others discovered 
the Gourmet Show Window,

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:29.890
where the Century Soup lies dormant.

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:33.960
Komatsu was entrusted to retrieve the 
soup, but while searching for it,

00:02:33.960 --> 00:02:36.000
he encountered a mystery man.

00:02:36.230 --> 00:02:40.870
Meanwhile, Tina, Zonge and his disciples 
also advanced towards the soup area.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:44.300
During the fierce battle between Toriko 
and his allies versus the Gourmet Corp.,

00:02:44.300 --> 00:02:47.810
Takimaru experienced great difficulties 
tangling with Bogie Woods.

00:02:47.810 --> 00:02:51.410
But after recalling the words of Aimaru, 
the leader of the Gourmet Knights,

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:53.480
Takimaru rises again!

00:02:55.310 --> 00:03:00.490
Settled! Match and Takimaru's 
Desperate Attacks!

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:09.960
How can you stand up with that much damage?!

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:13.600
There's still something I have to do!

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.300
The best preshot routine 
that Aimaru-san taught me...

00:03:21.370 --> 00:03:23.540
That again?

00:03:23.540 --> 00:03:28.180
Does doing that good luck charm really 
increase the power of your technique?

00:03:36.320 --> 00:03:38.020
Well, that's fine.

00:03:38.020 --> 00:03:40.960
There's still something I 
haven't quite finished as well.

00:03:42.090 --> 00:03:44.630
The movements...

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.460
...of this preshot routine takes a long time.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:50.770
Finish it in time!

00:03:55.210 --> 00:03:57.980
The thing I still have to do...

00:03:57.980 --> 00:04:00.980
...is finish you off!

00:04:05.480 --> 00:04:07.080
See ya!

00:04:12.620 --> 00:04:14.020
Son of a bitch!

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:16.890
Head Smash!

00:04:26.440 --> 00:04:28.640
How fast is this guy?!

00:04:31.340 --> 00:04:32.410
What's wrong?

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.540
Are you out of stamina already?!

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:41.280
Flying Fork!

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:55.000
I wonder how long you can last, Toriko?

00:04:55.000 --> 00:04:57.600
It's tough, isn't it,

00:04:57.600 --> 00:04:59.600
not being able to fight in 
close quarters, your specialty?

00:04:59.600 --> 00:05:02.840
Well, suffer even more!

00:05:10.850 --> 00:05:13.450
You've taken up a lot of my time,

00:05:13.450 --> 00:05:16.180
but no matter how much a 
guy like you struggles,

00:05:16.180 --> 00:05:17.590
it's pointless.

00:05:18.190 --> 00:05:20.220
It's not pointless!

00:05:21.660 --> 00:05:23.120
I made it...

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.660
The preshot routine...

00:05:25.660 --> 00:05:26.990
Ridiculous...

00:05:26.990 --> 00:05:28.530
This should've been a fatal wound!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:35.770
The charm I just did wasn't 
to strengthen my technique...

00:05:36.300 --> 00:05:42.180
It's a preshot routine done to maintain 
my concentration and remain undaunted,

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:44.040
no matter how much pain I'm in!

00:05:44.810 --> 00:05:48.820
You lose your concentration too quickly.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:51.890
So perform that before 
you do your techniques.

00:05:53.720 --> 00:05:56.560
I'm grateful to you, Aimaru-san.

00:05:56.560 --> 00:06:01.190
This is my final attack!

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:04.130
"Final attack", my ass!

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:07.730
Haven't you learned that your useless 
attacks are nothing but a waste of time?!

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:09.540
You're the one who's going to learn!

00:06:10.140 --> 00:06:12.570
Just before, you told me...

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:18.840
I can manipulate a body with a 
great number of different joints!

00:06:18.840 --> 00:06:22.580
I can enter pretty much any living creature.

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:24.020
Pretty much...

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:30.120
All those bones and joints you possess 
and move at will, yet "pretty much"...

00:06:30.120 --> 00:06:32.920
That means there are some 
things you <i>can't</i> enter!

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:37.360
And maybe there are some 
bones that you can't move?!

00:06:38.530 --> 00:06:42.030
I realized it after throwing 
a number of Corkscrew Shots,

00:06:42.030 --> 00:06:47.140
that you were slightly shifting 
away a point where I hit you.

00:06:48.670 --> 00:06:51.440
Do you have something there?

00:06:51.440 --> 00:06:54.410
For example, a bone that 
you don't want dislocated?!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.050
Iron Blow!

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.250
I found it!

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.590
Right here!

00:07:05.560 --> 00:07:07.660
Corkscrew Shot!

00:07:07.660 --> 00:07:09.030
Secret!

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:12.100
Corkscrew!

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.670
Come out!

00:07:20.800 --> 00:07:21.740
All right!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:29.850
Y-You little brat, y-you 
ripped out my sacrum!

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:34.450
So you did have one...

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.220
A sacrum...

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:39.920
In a normal human, the sacrum is 
an essential bone at the pelvis

00:07:39.920 --> 00:07:43.230
that supports the spine,

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:47.830
but your sacrum is a foundation that 
supports 4,000 individual bones,

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:51.400
with a shape and location 
different than normal ones!

00:07:51.400 --> 00:07:53.400
T-This guy...

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:58.570
Even while taking all that damage, 
he managed to discover my sacrum...

00:07:58.570 --> 00:08:04.310
Aimaru-san, I'm grateful for 
my final preshot routine...

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:05.580
And...

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:11.350
I'm sorry...

00:08:11.350 --> 00:08:13.460
...I couldn't get the soup...

00:08:13.460 --> 00:08:16.730
...and repay my debt to you.

00:08:20.060 --> 00:08:24.400
I-If I put the sacrum in just right...

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:26.430
...I'll be able to... move again.

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:29.540
M-Move, my body...

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:31.670
4,000 bones!

00:08:32.410 --> 00:08:34.980
Head Smash!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.780
Hold it, buddy!

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:46.420
Sword Split!

00:08:46.420 --> 00:08:48.320
Helmet Split!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.500
I-It can't be...

00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:01.770
I never thought I'd be retired 
in a place like this...

00:09:05.510 --> 00:09:07.440
Head Smash!

00:09:10.740 --> 00:09:12.510
What's this shaking?!

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:14.680
What the heck is happening?!

00:09:14.680 --> 00:09:18.520
What?! The more the events, the 
closer you are to clearing it!

00:09:18.520 --> 00:09:21.250
It means we're getting near the ending!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.260
I just hope it's not a bad ending...

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:26.190
Tonbi, you're impossible!

00:09:26.190 --> 00:09:27.730
It's Zonge!

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.930
Anyway, we've gotta get out of here!

00:09:33.570 --> 00:09:34.770
Komatsu-kun?

00:09:34.770 --> 00:09:37.170
I <i>told</i> you not to talk!

00:09:37.170 --> 00:09:40.710
Seriously, if you're not quiet, 
you won't be able to leave here!

00:09:41.140 --> 00:09:45.440
Although they're really 
going at it upstairs...

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:48.910
I have to hurry!

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:50.320
Please let go of me!

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:50.320
Hey, wait!

00:09:50.320 --> 00:09:53.820
I can't let you go any further!

00:09:51.450 --> 00:09:53.820
Let go!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:57.020
I have to get the soup!

00:09:57.020 --> 00:10:01.460
Komatsu, you get the soup!

00:10:01.460 --> 00:10:02.890
I'm counting on you!

00:10:02.890 --> 00:10:04.930
Toriko-san asked me to do something!

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:07.330
And no one's gonna get in my way!

00:10:12.200 --> 00:10:14.610
Ah, well...

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:17.340
I didn't expect <i>him</i> to be there...

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:20.040
He has no chance of beating this tiny one.

00:10:20.040 --> 00:10:22.910
He'll never find it...

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:25.120
Still, impressive as always, Yuu-sama.

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:28.790
The mini GT Robots are 
difficult enough to pilot,

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.760
but for you to skillfully manipulate 
it from all the way over here...

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:37.760
While Tommy-sama keeps Toriko 
in check, I'll capture the soup.

00:10:39.060 --> 00:10:43.330
The Gourmet Corp. alone will 
possess the Century Soup.

00:10:59.420 --> 00:11:02.050
I've gotta do something about these bugs!

00:11:02.050 --> 00:11:05.250
Can't afford to kick the bucket here!

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:07.460
Takimaru!

00:11:08.490 --> 00:11:11.990
You end in a draw with the 
likes of him? Pathetic, Bogie!

00:11:11.990 --> 00:11:14.430
You really are worthless!

00:11:14.800 --> 00:11:16.530
He's your ally, isn't he?!

00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:23.970
You don't talk that way to an ally who's 
given everything he's got in battle!

00:11:23.970 --> 00:11:25.170
Hah?!

00:11:26.240 --> 00:11:29.140
What are you talking about?

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:33.450
For someone with that much 
bulk, you're a fast bastard.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:37.720
You'd be better off not 
judging me by the way I look!

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:39.820
Mince Crush!

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:49.100
Crush! Crush! Crush!

00:11:50.660 --> 00:11:52.030
His reactions are damn fast!

00:11:52.030 --> 00:11:54.340
Mince Crush!

00:11:57.000 --> 00:11:57.870
Match-san!

00:11:57.870 --> 00:11:59.270
Oil Shock!

00:12:03.840 --> 00:12:04.810
Sudden...

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.550
Shell Shield!

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:08.280
...Triple Slice!

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:18.890
Really nice sword...

00:12:18.890 --> 00:12:22.400
The blade cut my shell 
without even shattering...

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:24.660
That's my line.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:27.630
This blade couldn't even damage it...

00:12:27.630 --> 00:12:29.440
That's some impressive armor.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:31.770
Well, of course.

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:41.480
Crush Turtle (Reptilian 
Beast) Capture Level 60

00:12:31.770 --> 00:12:35.070
The armor's made from the 
shell of a Crush Turtle,

00:12:35.070 --> 00:12:38.480
a Capture Level 60 rampaging sea turtle.

00:12:38.480 --> 00:12:41.510
The shell is harder than 
dozens of plates of iron.

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:43.680
Even in the Natural World, 
it's among the best.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:49.190
What surprised me more than that is 
your ability to move at such a speed

00:12:49.190 --> 00:12:52.760
at a sub-zero temperature and without 
wearing any insulated clothing.

00:12:59.560 --> 00:13:00.300
What the...?!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:01.100
Is that sweat?!

00:13:01.100 --> 00:13:03.100
This is fluid that doesn't freeze...

00:13:03.100 --> 00:13:04.540
Anti-freeze!

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:08.040
There are fish in subzero ocean 
waters that naturally produce

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:10.510
antifreeze to keep from freezing.

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:13.710
My body can create the same thing.

00:13:13.710 --> 00:13:16.280
So that's why you can move 
without becoming an icicle,

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:17.950
even at a subzero temperature.

00:13:17.950 --> 00:13:21.820
And that must also be why the ice machine 
gun's bullets just slid off of you.

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:25.360
My antifreeze makes my skin 
even smoother than a boxer

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.830
who's got vaseline on his 
face to protect the skin.

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:33.230
But I still don't get why your 
reactions and movements are so fast.

00:13:33.230 --> 00:13:35.770
I ain't fast!

00:13:36.200 --> 00:13:39.270
You're slow!

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:43.870
Mince Crush!

00:13:50.380 --> 00:13:52.350
Too slow!

00:13:54.380 --> 00:13:56.690
Mince Lariat!

00:13:59.760 --> 00:14:00.660
Match-san!

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:05.730
Do you really think you're 
moving at your normal speed?

00:14:05.730 --> 00:14:07.630
It's below zero.

00:14:08.260 --> 00:14:10.670
When the temperature is low like this,

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:13.440
people just can't give 
their best performance.

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:19.610
I can keep my temperature up with a special 
antifreezing protein my body makes.

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:20.580
In other words...

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.450
...my body is always in top gear!

00:14:23.650 --> 00:14:28.220
I can always give my best performance!

00:14:28.220 --> 00:14:31.320
True, the cold has dulled my movement.

00:14:31.320 --> 00:14:34.390
I can't generate any power of speed either.

00:14:35.320 --> 00:14:38.230
I need to have more swing.

00:14:42.430 --> 00:14:45.970
I have to relax more...

00:14:46.870 --> 00:14:49.870
All right! You've decided 
to accept your fate, eh?

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.310
It'll take just a moment to mince you!

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.740
Is charging straight ahead all you can do?!

00:14:55.740 --> 00:14:58.010
Try changing direction once in a while!

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.250
We'll square off against ya!

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:03.450
They won't go bad in this cold,

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:06.690
but it looks like three scraps 
of food have turned up.

00:15:06.920 --> 00:15:11.060
They intend to buy me some time...

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:15.200
Sorry, but hang in there just a little while.

00:15:15.860 --> 00:15:20.900
It takes three minutes to 
achieve complete relaxation.

00:15:22.470 --> 00:15:24.270
Mince Crush!

00:15:28.480 --> 00:15:29.740
Oh, come on!

00:15:29.940 --> 00:15:32.610
At least hold out for ten seconds per man!

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.710
B-Bastard!

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:36.020
Match-san! Please continue!

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:41.550
B-Believe in us... and relax!

00:15:41.550 --> 00:15:46.290
I wanna let the kids in 
Nerg City have that soup!

00:15:51.930 --> 00:15:57.040
Anger causes the muscles to tense 
and puts great strain on the body.

00:15:57.900 --> 00:15:59.510
This isn't easy.

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:05.080
Even now, with this magma of anger 
about to erupt, I have to relax...

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:07.410
Achieve deep relaxation...

00:16:07.410 --> 00:16:10.820
Be angry quietly... Coolly...

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:16.050
Once I've achieved relaxation, this 
anger will bring forth a full swing.

00:16:16.050 --> 00:16:18.820
Just lie down and die!

00:16:23.460 --> 00:16:26.030
Head Smash!

00:16:31.440 --> 00:16:33.700
It doesn't even work at point blank range?!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:37.140
Mince Lariat!

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:39.740
Just big talkers, huh?

00:16:39.740 --> 00:16:41.350
You're all trash!

00:16:43.410 --> 00:16:50.190
Exactly how much of a swing 
will this anger bring forth?

00:16:55.460 --> 00:16:58.000
Rum! Shin! Rui!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:16:59.900
What nonsense.

00:16:59.900 --> 00:17:02.970
It's like they just threw 
their lives away, isn't it?

00:17:02.970 --> 00:17:07.870
Although maybe it's a fitting end to garbage!

00:17:07.870 --> 00:17:10.170
Spiked Punch!

00:17:13.110 --> 00:17:17.950
They were prepared to throw their lives away

00:17:17.950 --> 00:17:22.150
from the moment they decided to come here!

00:17:22.150 --> 00:17:24.820
Huh? They were prepared?

00:17:27.020 --> 00:17:28.560
What a joke!

00:17:28.560 --> 00:17:31.190
And they became garbage like that!

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:32.660
Were they just stupid?

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:36.630
For making fun of their resolution,

00:17:36.630 --> 00:17:40.700
you're going to pay if 
it's the last thing I do!

00:17:40.700 --> 00:17:42.100
How annoying.

00:17:42.100 --> 00:17:45.640
You're seriously ticking me off...

00:17:45.640 --> 00:17:48.440
This time, I'm gonna deliver the final blow!

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.450
N-Not yet!

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:54.420
The kids... are waiting for their soup.

00:17:54.420 --> 00:17:56.080
Can't afford to die here...

00:17:56.080 --> 00:17:59.350
Annoying piece of trash!

00:18:04.460 --> 00:18:06.590
M-Match-san...

00:18:06.590 --> 00:18:09.860
If you guys are done in by nature,

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:13.600
I don't know who to take revenge against.

00:18:13.600 --> 00:18:18.510
P-Please... avenge us...

00:18:22.640 --> 00:18:23.980
Three minutes...

00:18:23.980 --> 00:18:25.410
...have passed.

00:18:25.410 --> 00:18:27.680
The mincing is complete.

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:33.720
Although you can't cook a damned thing 
with minced garbage like this, you know?

00:18:33.720 --> 00:18:37.120
Hey, I've got three pieces 
of kitchen waste here!

00:18:37.120 --> 00:18:38.690
They're your buddies, right?

00:18:38.690 --> 00:18:40.890
Make sure you take out the trash.

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:43.860
Oh, maybe you can't do it...

00:18:43.860 --> 00:18:47.400
...since you're gonna turn into trash, too!

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:49.900
A huge piece of garbage!

00:19:15.590 --> 00:19:16.530
What the...?!

00:19:16.530 --> 00:19:18.800
That was so fast, I couldn't see a thing.

00:19:18.800 --> 00:19:24.940
You said that armor was made from 
the shell of a Crush Turtle, right?

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:27.670
Now I'll share with you 
what my weapon's made of.

00:19:27.670 --> 00:19:32.410
This blade was made from 
a certain dragon's fang.

00:19:32.410 --> 00:19:35.410
Those fangs can rip and chew 
apart anything in this world

00:19:35.410 --> 00:19:43.090
Their owner is the Capture Level 68, 
sea-dwelling king of dragons, Leo Dragon!

00:19:39.080 --> 00:19:43.690
Leo Dragon (Water Dragon 
Beast) Capture Level 68

00:19:43.090 --> 00:19:47.990
It's a monster that crushes the Crush 
Turtle's shell, then preys on it!

00:19:49.130 --> 00:19:50.460
No way...

00:19:52.530 --> 00:19:56.300
Rum... Shin... Rui...

00:19:56.300 --> 00:19:57.970
I avenged you.

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:00.970
Split in half?!

00:20:00.970 --> 00:20:02.870
The strongest of armor?!

00:20:02.870 --> 00:20:06.010
The highest state of relaxation 
and the ultimate anger...

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:08.980
The Leo Dragon's gimmick is 
its instantaneous ability

00:20:08.980 --> 00:20:11.720
to go from an imperceptible 
state to attacking.

00:20:11.720 --> 00:20:14.020
My fine sword, Dragon King...

00:20:14.020 --> 00:20:18.160
This may have been the first time 
I've fully utilized its strength.

00:20:18.820 --> 00:20:23.060
I-I've been done in by trash...

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:25.430
By all you trash!

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:26.900
Draw.

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:29.930
Dragon King Sword Split.

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:34.940
You were the trash.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:38.110
Oversize garbage.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:40.940
Not yet...

00:20:40.940 --> 00:20:44.710
Can't fall yet...

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:48.220
Got to help Toriko and get the soup...

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:52.860
W-What is that?!

00:21:14.380 --> 00:21:18.610
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:19.680 --> 00:21:22.880
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:26.220
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:26.520 --> 00:21:29.690
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:29.690 --> 00:21:33.060
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:33.060 --> 00:21:36.130
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:36.130 --> 00:21:39.900
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:43.470
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:43.470 --> 00:21:46.610
Two-way communication!

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:50.110
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:50.380 --> 00:21:53.880
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:21:53.880 --> 00:21:57.250
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:21:57.250 --> 00:21:59.090
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:21:59.090 --> 00:22:03.790
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:07.360
Fight with bravery!

00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:11.060
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:17.970
Gourmet News!

00:22:18.370 --> 00:22:20.170
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:20.170 --> 00:22:23.680
Ice Hell, where it's so bitterly 
cold that your movements are dulled.

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:27.280
In a place like that, you want 
something that'll warm you up, right?

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:30.020
This time, I'm going to show you a simple way

00:22:30.020 --> 00:22:33.350
to make corn soup without the corn.

00:22:33.350 --> 00:22:36.560
First, thinly chop yellow pickled radish

00:22:36.560 --> 00:22:38.860
and put it into warm milk.

00:22:39.260 --> 00:22:42.060
Let the flavors mix for a while...

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:45.500
...and you have yourself some corn soup!

00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:49.670
It's warm and delicious!

00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:52.870
But yellow pickled radish 
is actually colored daikon,

00:22:52.870 --> 00:22:54.710
so instead of corn soup, it's actually...

00:22:54.710 --> 00:22:56.670
...<i>dyed-corn</i> soup!

00:22:56.670 --> 00:22:58.110
Get it?

00:22:59.180 --> 00:23:02.350
Huh? Even though I just drank 
warm soup, it's freezing in here!

00:23:02.710 --> 00:23:05.020
Now, on to the next story.

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:09.050
At long last, Toriko VS Tommy, one-on-one.

00:23:09.050 --> 00:23:11.390
And a mysterious man makes a big announcement.

00:23:11.390 --> 00:23:13.460
Will the soup be found!?

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:16.960
The Gourmet Reviver and the Legendary Soup's Location!

00:23:17.220 --> 00:23:19.060
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
